    class Item3
    {
        dataType="Comment";
        class PositionInfo {position[]={0,0,-5};};
        title="Enable Waldo_SupplyTransfers_Enable in MissionConfig/logisticsConfig.sqf. Physical cargo is on by default. The two boxes and Prowler register for two-way inventory transfers; the box Init calls also permit visible mounting and ACE Carry. Select a source box, then merge into the other box or vehicle. For individual items, use Transfer from this box. Carry a box onto the Prowler to test seat blocking. Keep the vehicle's simulation and collision enabled. No seat coordinates are needed. Wikis: https://github.com/AdamWaldie/WaldosMissionPack/wiki/Supply-Transfers and https://github.com/AdamWaldie/WaldosMissionPack/wiki/Physical-Cargo";
        id=4;
    };
